        // LegalDocumentsDialog.kt (Privacy Policy & Terms of Service)
        "1. Scope & Data Controller (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Alcance y responsable de datos (Actualizado: noviembre 2026)",
        "This Privacy Policy explains how Finsay (finsayapp.com, package com.kynigos.oikonomos) collects, uses, processes, stores, and protects your personal and financial tracking data. It is designed to comply with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR 2016/679), Greek Law 4624/2019, the UK GDPR, applicable United States privacy statutes (including the California CCPA/CPRA, Virginia VCDPA, Colorado CPA, Connecticut CTDPA, and Texas TDPSA), and Google Play Developer Program Policies. Data Controller contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "Esta Política de Privacidad explica cómo Finsay (finsayapp.com, paquete com.kynigos.oikonomos) recopila, utiliza, almacena y protege tus datos personales y financieros. Cumple con el RGPD de la UE (2016/679), la Ley griega 4624/2019, el UK GDPR, las leyes de privacidad aplicables de EE. UU. (CCPA/CPRA, VCDPA, CPA, CTDPA, TDPSA) y las políticas de Google Play. Contacto del responsable: support@finsayapp.com.",
        "2. Categories of Data Collected & Profile Isolation" to "2. Categorías de datos recopilados y aislamiento del perfil",
        "• Account & Authentication Data: Name, email address, unique user identifier (UID), and profile photo obtained via Google Sign-In (Android Credential Manager) or Email/Password through Firebase Authentication.\n• Private Profile Details (Strictly Owner-Only): Optional fields such as phone number, date of birth, occupation, and city are isolated in a private sub-document readable and writable exclusively by your authenticated account—never exposed to other users during ledger-sharing lookups.\n• Financial & Budget Records: Amounts, titles/descriptions, categories, dates, payment sources, selected ledger currency, incomes, monthly budgets, recurring bills, savings goals, and member split/settle-up entries voluntarily logged by you.\n• Shared Household Data: Member nicknames, roles (Creator, Editor, Registar), shared ledger links, and an activity log of ledger edits visible to authorized members of that ledger.\n• Preferences & Local Settings: Language (EL/EN), theme mode, reminder schedules, and local merchant-to-category memory." to "• Datos de cuenta y autenticación: nombre, correo electrónico, identificador único (UID) y foto de perfil obtenidos mediante Google Sign-In o correo/contraseña a través de Firebase Authentication.\n• Perfil privado (solo propietario): campos opcionales como teléfono, fecha de nacimiento, profesión y ciudad se guardan en un subdocumento privado accesible exclusivamente por tu cuenta, nunca visible para otros usuarios.\n• Registros financieros: importes, descripciones, categorías, fechas, moneda del libro, ingresos, presupuestos, facturas recurrentes, metas de ahorro y repartos registrados por ti.\n• Libros compartidos: apodos de miembros, roles (Creador, Editor, Registrador), enlaces y registro de actividad visible para los miembros autorizados.\n• Preferencias locales: idioma, tema, horarios de recordatorio y memoria local de comercios.",
        "3. Bank & Wallet Push Notification Reader (Optional, 100% On-Device)" to "3. Lector de notificaciones bancarias (Opcional, 100% local)",
        "• Strictly Opt-In: The Bank Notification Auto-Catcher (Android NotificationListenerService) is completely disabled by default. It activates ONLY after you review our in-app Prominent Disclosure and manually grant Notification Access in Android System Settings.\n• Strict Filtering & On-Device Parsing: Finsay filters solely for recognized banking and digital wallet notification packages (ignoring personal messages, chats, emails, and OTP/2FA codes). Merchant name and transaction amount are parsed 100% locally in device memory.\n• Zero Transmission & Explicit Save: Raw notification text is NEVER uploaded to Finsay servers, logged externally, or shared with third parties. Detected alerts create a local draft only; an expense is saved and synced to the cloud ONLY if you actively tap Save/Confirm.\n• No Bank Credentials / No Open Banking: Finsay never collects banking logins, passwords, card numbers, PINs, or PSD2/Open Banking tokens.\n• Revocation: You may disable this feature anytime in App Settings or Android System Settings." to "• Activación voluntaria: el lector bancario (NotificationListenerService) está desactivado por defecto y solo se activa si concedes el permiso manualmente en Ajustes de Android.\n• Filtrado estricto y análisis local: Finsay filtra únicamente notificaciones de bancos y carteras compatibles (ignorando mensajes, chats, correos y códigos OTP) y analiza importe y comercio 100% en el dispositivo.\n• Cero envíos y confirmación explícita: el texto de las notificaciones nunca se sube ni comparte. Solo crea un borrador local que se guarda únicamente si pulsas Guardar/Confirmar.\n• Sin credenciales bancarias: Finsay nunca solicita claves bancarias, tarjetas, PIN ni tokens PSD2.\n• Revocación: puedes desactivarlo en cualquier momento en Ajustes.",
        "4. Camera, Receipt OCR, AADE/e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. Cámara, OCR de recibos, consulta QR AADE y entrada por voz",
        "• Camera & Photo Picker: Camera access (CAMERA) or the zero-permission Android Photo Picker is used solely when you choose to scan a receipt or QR code. OCR text recognition and barcode decoding run locally on-device via Google ML Kit; receipt images are not uploaded to Finsay servers.\n• Greek AADE / e-Invoicing QR Verification: When you scan a Greek tax/e-invoicing QR code, the app may perform a direct, read-only HTTPS lookup strictly to allowlisted official tax/e-invoicing domains (e.g., aade.gr and certified Greek e-invoicing providers) solely to retrieve merchant name, VAT/AFM, date, and total amount.\n• Voice Expense Entry (RECORD_AUDIO): Used only when you press the microphone button. Speech-to-text relies on Android's native SpeechRecognizer service (subject to your device/Google speech service terms), and the resulting text is parsed locally into a draft expense. Finsay does NOT record, save, or upload audio files." to "• Cámara y galería: se usan solo cuando decides escanear un recibo o código QR. El OCR y la lectura de códigos se ejecutan localmente mediante Google ML Kit; las imágenes no se suben a servidores de Finsay.\n• Verificación QR AADE: al escanear un QR fiscal griego, la app puede realizar una consulta HTTPS de solo lectura a dominios oficiales autorizados (como aade.gr) para obtener comercio, NIF, fecha e importe.\n• Entrada por voz (RECORD_AUDIO): se utiliza solo al pulsar el micrófono mediante el servicio nativo SpeechRecognizer de Android. Finsay no graba, guarda ni sube archivos de audio.",
        "5. Biometric App Lock, Local Merchant Memory & Device Features" to "5. Bloqueo biométrico, memoria local y funciones del dispositivo",
        "• Optional Biometric & PIN App Lock: Fingerprint/Face Unlock uses Android BiometricPrompt handled exclusively by your device's secure OS hardware. Finsay NEVER accesses, collects, stores, or transmits biometric identifiers or templates (compliant with GDPR Art. 9 and US state biometric laws such as BIPA/CUBI). Any optional 4-digit PIN is stored strictly on-device as a salted SHA-256 hash.\n• Smart Merchant Category Memory: Category corrections for merchants/VAT IDs are stored locally on-device (SharedPreferences) solely to improve auto-suggestions.\n• Reminders, Widgets, Quick Tile & App Shortcuts: Local notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS, RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED, WAKE_LOCK, VIBRATE) deliver user-configured reminders and bank-draft prompts. Widgets, Quick Settings tiles, and launcher App Shortcuts operate locally." to "• Bloqueo biométrico y PIN opcional: usa Android BiometricPrompt gestionado por el sistema. Finsay nunca accede ni almacena datos biométricos. El PIN opcional de 4 dígitos se guarda localmente como hash SHA-256 con sal.\n• Memoria inteligente de comercios: tus correcciones de categoría por comercio se almacenan solo localmente para mejorar sugerencias.\n• Recordatorios, widgets y accesos rápidos: las notificaciones locales y accesos directos funcionan íntegramente en el dispositivo.",
        "6. Legal Bases (GDPR / UK GDPR), Zero Ads & No Data Selling" to "6. Bases legales (RGPD), cero anuncios y no venta de datos",
        "• Performance of Contract (Art. 6(1)(b)): Delivering budgeting, multi-currency tracking, analytics, cloud sync, shared ledgers, and data exports.\n• Consent (Art. 6(1)(a)): Mandatory acceptance of these Terms & Privacy Policy (version and timestamp recorded in your private owner-only profile), plus optional bank notification parsing, camera/OCR, microphone voice input, and reminder notifications (withdrawable anytime).\n• Legitimate Interests (Art. 6(1)(f)): Ensuring security, preventing unauthorized access via Firebase Authentication and Zero-Trust Firestore Security Rules, and maintaining service reliability.\n• Zero Ads, No Data Brokers & No Third-Party AI Uploads: Finsay displays no ads, does NOT sell or rent personal data, does NOT share personal data for cross-context behavioral advertising, and does NOT transmit your financial data to third-party cloud LLM/AI services." to "• Ejecución de contrato (Art. 6.1.b): prestación del seguimiento financiero, presupuestos, sincronización, libros compartidos y exportaciones.\n• Consentimiento (Art. 6.1.a): aceptación de estos Términos y Política, y funciones opcionales (lector bancario, cámara/OCR, voz y recordatorios), revocable en cualquier momento.\n• Interés legítimo (Art. 6.1.f): seguridad de cuentas, reglas Zero-Trust en Firestore y fiabilidad del servicio.\n• Sin anuncios ni venta de datos: Finsay no muestra publicidad, no vende ni alquila datos personales ni los envía a servicios externos de IA.",
        "7. Cloud Infrastructure, Security & International Transfers" to "7. Infraestructura en la nube, seguridad y transferencias",
        "• Storage & Security: Cloud data is hosted on Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore with TLS encryption in transit, AES encryption at rest, Firebase Authentication, and Zero-Trust Security Rules restricting reads/writes to authorized ledger members.\n• International Data Transfers: Because Google Cloud / Firebase operates global infrastructure (including EU and US servers), any transfers outside the EEA or UK are safeguarded by EU Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs), the UK International Data Transfer Addendum, and Google LLC's certification under the EU-US / UK-US Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play Services: Finsay Pro purchases are processed exclusively by Google Play Billing (we never see or store payment card details). Native Google Play In-App Updates and In-App Review APIs may run discreetly under Google's Privacy Policy." to "• Seguridad: los datos en la nube se alojan en Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore con cifrado TLS en tránsito, AES en reposo, Firebase Authentication y reglas Zero-Trust.\n• Transferencias internacionales: las transferencias fuera del EEE o Reino Unido están protegidas mediante Cláusulas Contractuales Tipo de la UE y el marco de privacidad UE-EE. UU.\n• Google Play: las compras de Finsay Pro se procesan exclusivamente mediante Google Play Billing; nunca vemos ni almacenamos datos bancarios o de tarjeta.",
        "8. Data Retention, Exports & Permanent Account Deletion" to "8. Retención de datos, exportación y eliminación de cuenta",
        "• Retention: We retain your account and ledger data only for as long as your account remains active or until you delete specific entries or your entire account.\n• Data Portability: You may export your expenses, incomes, balances, and member settle-up summaries to Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf), or CSV (.csv) locally on-device anytime.\n• Immediate Account Deletion: You may permanently delete your account, private profile, owned ledgers, and cloud/local data directly in the app (Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account) or via https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html. Residual cloud backups are purged within standard infrastructure cycles (up to 30 days)." to "• Retención: conservamos tus datos mientras tu cuenta esté activa o hasta que los elimines.\n• Portabilidad: puedes exportar gastos, ingresos, saldos y liquidaciones a Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf) o CSV (.csv) en cualquier momento.\n• Eliminación inmediata: puedes borrar permanentemente tu cuenta y todos tus datos desde Menú (☰) > Perfil > Eliminar cuenta o en https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html. Las copias residuales se depuran en hasta 30 días.",
        "9. Your Rights (Greece, EU/EEA, UK & United States)" to "9. Tus derechos (UE/EEE, Reino Unido y EE. UU.)",
        "• Greece, EU/EEA & UK (GDPR / Law 4624/2019 / UK GDPR): You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, data portability, object, withdraw consent at any time, and lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority—including the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (HDPA, www.dpa.gr) or the UK ICO.\n• United States (California CCPA/CPRA & State Privacy Laws — VA, CO, CT, UT, TX, etc.): US residents have the right to know/access personal information collected, request deletion, request correction of inaccurate data, obtain a portable copy, and receive non-discriminatory treatment when exercising privacy rights. Finsay DOES NOT \"sell\" personal information and DOES NOT \"share\" personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising. Sensitive personal information is used strictly as necessary to provide requested app features.\n• Exercising Rights: Use in-app tools or email support@finsayapp.com; we verify and respond within 30 days (or the statutory period under applicable law)." to "• UE/EEE y Reino Unido (RGPD): tienes derecho de acceso, rectificación, supresión, limitación, portabilidad, oposición, retirada del consentimiento y reclamación ante la autoridad competente (como la HDPA, www.dpa.gr).\n• Estados Unidos (CCPA/CPRA y leyes estatales): derecho a conocer, eliminar, corregir y portar datos sin discriminación. Finsay no vende ni comparte datos para publicidad conductual.\n• Ejercicio de derechos: usa las herramientas de la app o escribe a support@finsayapp.com; respondemos en un plazo máximo de 30 días.",
        "10. Children's Privacy (COPPA & GDPR Art. 8) & Changes" to "10. Privacidad de menores y cambios en la política",
        "• Children's Privacy: Finsay is not intended for children under 13 years of age (US COPPA) or under 16 years of age (or the applicable digital consent age in your EU/EEA/UK country under GDPR Art. 8). We do not knowingly collect data from children; contact support@finsayapp.com for immediate deletion if you believe a child provided data.\n• Policy Updates: We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect new features or legal requirements. Material changes will be notified in-app or on finsayapp.com." to "• Menores: Finsay no está dirigida a menores de 13 años (COPPA) ni de 16 años en la UE/EEE (o la edad digital legal aplicable). Si crees que un menor ha proporcionado datos, escribe a support@finsayapp.com para eliminarlos de inmediato.\n• Actualizaciones: podemos actualizar esta política por cambios legales o funcionales, notificándolos en la app o en finsayapp.com.",
        "1. Acceptance of Terms & Eligibility (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Aceptación de términos y elegibilidad (Actualizado: noviembre 2026)",
        "By downloading, installing, registering for, or using Finsay (finsayapp.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy. You must be at least 16 years old in the EU/EEA/UK (or the applicable legal digital consent age in your jurisdiction) and at least 13 years old in the United States (or have verifiable parental consent where required) to use Finsay. If you do not agree, do not use the application." to "Al descargar, instalar o usar Finsay (finsayapp.com), aceptas estos Términos de Servicio y nuestra Política de Privacidad. Debes tener al menos 16 años en la UE/EEE/Reino Unido (o la edad legal aplicable) y al menos 13 años en EE. UU. Si no estás de acuerdo, no utilices la aplicación.",
        "2. Service Description & Strict Financial / Tax Advice Disclaimer" to "2. Descripción del servicio y exención de asesoramiento financiero",
        "Finsay is an informational personal and household expense, income, budget, multi-currency, and split-tracking tool. Finsay DOES NOT provide financial, investment, banking, accounting, legal, or tax advice, nor does it execute payments, currency conversions, or money transfers. Displayed currencies are purely organizational labels; Finsay does not perform regulated foreign-exchange brokerage. You remain solely responsible for verifying all figures, tax obligations, and financial decisions." to "Finsay es una herramienta informativa de control de gastos, ingresos, presupuestos y repartos. No ofrece asesoramiento financiero, fiscal, contable ni legal, ni ejecuta pagos ni cambios de divisas. Las monedas mostradas son meramente organizativas. Eres responsable de verificar todas las cifras y decisiones financieras.",
        "3. Bank Notification Reader Disclaimer (No Open Banking / PSD2)" to "3. Aviso sobre el lector bancario (Sin Open Banking / PSD2)",
        "• Independent Local Utility: The optional Bank Notification Auto-Catcher reads Android payment notifications solely on-device after your explicit system authorization. Finsay is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any bank, card issuer, or payment institution, and does NOT operate as a PSD2 / Open Banking Account Information Service Provider (AISP) or Payment Initiation Service Provider (PISP).\n• Best-Effort Accuracy: Because banks frequently change notification wording and Android battery/OEM policies may delay or restrict background delivery, Finsay cannot guarantee that every card payment will be detected or parsed with 100% accuracy. You must review and confirm every draft before saving and rely on official bank statements for authoritative records." to "• Utilidad local independiente: el lector bancario opcional lee notificaciones solo en tu dispositivo tras tu autorización. Finsay no está afiliada a ningún banco ni opera como proveedor PSD2 / Open Banking.\n• Precisión orientativa: dado que los bancos modifican sus textos y Android puede limitar procesos en segundo plano, revisa y confirma cada borrador y usa tus extractos bancarios oficiales como referencia.",
        "4. Receipt OCR, AADE / e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. OCR de recibos, consulta QR AADE y entrada por voz",
        "Optical character recognition (OCR), QR receipt lookups (including direct read-only queries to allowlisted Greek tax/e-invoicing portals such as AADE), and voice-to-text parsing are automated convenience features that may occasionally misread text, speech, dates, or totals. Finsay is not affiliated with AADE or any e-invoicing provider. You are solely responsible for checking and correcting auto-filled values against original receipts before saving." to "El reconocimiento OCR, las consultas QR AADE y el dictado por voz son ayudas automáticas que pueden interpretar erróneamente textos, fechas o importes. Finsay no está afiliada a AADE. Debes comprobar y corregir los valores antes de guardar.",
        "5. Shared Households, Member Roles & Third-Party Consent" to "5. Libros compartidos, roles y consentimiento de terceros",
        "When creating or participating in a shared ledger (Creator, Editor, Registar), you acknowledge that financial entries, split balances, and ledger activity logs are visible to all authorized members of that ledger according to their roles. You represent and warrant that you have obtained appropriate consent before entering another individual's personal information or inviting them to a shared ledger, and you are responsible for managing member access in ledgers you control." to "Al participar en un libro compartido (Creador, Editor, Registrador), aceptas que los movimientos, saldos y registros de actividad son visibles para los miembros autorizados. Garantizas contar con el consentimiento necesario antes de añadir o invitar a terceros.",
        "6. Account Security, Optional App Lock & Data Exports" to "6. Seguridad de la cuenta, bloqueo local y exportaciones",
        "• Credentials & Local App Lock: You are responsible for safeguarding your sign-in credentials and device. Optional Biometric/PIN App Lock is a local convenience safeguard; if you forget your PIN or lose device biometric access, recovery may require re-authentication or reinstalling the app.\n• Exported Files: When you export reports (Excel, PDF, CSV) and share them via third-party apps (email, messaging, cloud drives), those exported copies leave Finsay's control and their confidentiality becomes your sole responsibility." to "• Credenciales y bloqueo: eres responsable de proteger tus credenciales y dispositivo. Si olvidas tu PIN local, puede ser necesario volver a iniciar sesión o reinstalar la app.\n• Archivos exportados: al exportar informes (Excel, PDF, CSV) y compartirlos en apps de terceros, su confidencialidad pasa a ser tu responsabilidad.",
        "7. Finsay Pro Subscriptions, Renewals & Refunds (Google Play)" to "7. Suscripciones Finsay Pro, renovaciones y reembolsos",
        "• Billing & Auto-Renewal: Certain advanced features (such as Bank Notification Auto-Catcher, multiple ledgers, and unlimited members) require a Finsay Pro subscription or lifetime purchase processed exclusively via Google Play Billing. Recurring subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled in Google Play settings before the end of the current billing period.\n• Refunds & Consumer Rights: Pricing, cancellations, and refund requests are governed by Google Play's billing policies and applicable mandatory consumer laws in your jurisdiction (including statutory EU/UK withdrawal rights where applicable and US consumer statutes)." to "• Facturación y renovación: ciertas funciones avanzadas requieren suscripción o compra de por vida Finsay Pro gestionada exclusivamente por Google Play Billing. Las suscripciones se renuevan automáticamente salvo cancelación previa en Google Play.\n• Reembolsos y derechos: los precios, cancelaciones y reembolsos se rigen por Google Play y las leyes de consumo vigentes.",
        "8. Acceptable Use & Intellectual Property" to "8. Uso aceptable y propiedad intelectual",
        "You agree not to misuse Finsay, bypass authentication or security rules, attempt unauthorized access to other users' data, reverse-engineer or copy proprietary components except as permitted by mandatory law, or use the app for fraudulent or unlawful purposes. All Finsay trademarks, branding, design, and software remain the intellectual property of Finsay and its creators." to "Te comprometes a no hacer un uso indebido de Finsay, ni eludir su seguridad, acceder sin permiso a datos ajenos o realizar ingeniería inversa salvo lo permitido por ley. Todas las marcas, diseños y software son propiedad intelectual de Finsay.",
        "9. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability" to "9. Exención de garantías y limitación de responsabilidad",
        "To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Finsay is provided \"AS IS\" and \"AS AVAILABLE\" without warranties of uninterrupted operation or error-free parsing. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Finsay and its developers shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, punitive, or consequential damages, missed bill reminders, unparsed notifications, or loss of profits/data; aggregate liability shall not exceed the total amount paid by you for Finsay Pro during the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.\n• Statutory Carve-Out (EU/UK/US): Nothing in these Terms excludes or limits liability that cannot legally be excluded under mandatory law (including gross negligence, willful misconduct, fraud, or mandatory statutory consumer rights in the EU/EEA, UK, or US states)." to "En la medida permitida por la ley, Finsay se ofrece \"TAL CUAL\" sin garantías de funcionamiento ininterrumpido. Finsay no responde por daños indirectos, recordatorios perdidos o errores de lectura; la responsabilidad total no superará lo abonado por Finsay Pro en los últimos 12 meses, sin limitar derechos legales irrenunciables del consumidor en la UE/EEE, Reino Unido o EE. UU.",
        "10. Termination, Changes, Governing Law & International Consumer Rights" to "10. Terminación, cambios y legislación aplicable",
        "• Termination: You may terminate your account anytime via Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account. We may suspend accounts that materially violate these Terms or threaten platform security.\n• Governing Law & Consumer Carve-Out: These Terms are governed by the laws of the Hellenic Republic (Greece) and applicable European Union law, with disputes submitted to the courts of Athens, Greece. However, if you are a consumer residing in the EU/EEA, the UK, or the United States, nothing in these Terms deprives you of the mandatory consumer protection laws or statutory forum rights of your country or state of residence.\n• Contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "• Terminación: puedes cerrar tu cuenta en Menú (☰) > Perfil > Eliminar cuenta. Podemos suspender cuentas por incumplimiento grave.\n• Ley aplicable: estos Términos se rigen por las leyes de Grecia y la UE (tribunales de Atenas), sin perjuicio de las normas imperativas de protección al consumidor de tu país o estado de residencia.\n• Contacto: support@finsayapp.com."
    )
}
